## Why This Is Asked
This checks augmentation basics, order statistics, and duplicates in a beginner-friendly BST task. It also introduces practical thinking about edge cases like removing last copy.

## Key Concepts
- Augmented BST (or Treap/AVL) with per-node size
- Duplicate counts in a single node
- Rank and kth selection in a dynamic set

## Code Example
